    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried the tea and the rest but the pain is literally unbearable... it's making me feel nauseous too. i'm really worried about whether i'm doing something wrong. i found some advil in my cabinet that's 400mg per pill, would it be okay if i just took two of those to finally get some relief? i'm just so desperate to stop the throbbing so i can actually function today.",
